  "id": "instructional-treatment",
  "term": "instructional treatment",
  "definition": "Instructional treatment is the teaching or learning experience given to learners as part of an educational intervention or lesson sequence. In this context, it refers to the instruction children receive, which can vary in how much it improves their skills from one child to another.",
